    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:NEH:5:2",
      "sequence": 12385,
      "chapter_label": "NEH 5",
      "verse_label": "2",
      "locator": {
        "book": "NEH",
        "chapter": 5,
        "verse": 2
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "NEH",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "For there were some who said, “We, our sons and our daughters, are many. Let us get grain, that we may eat and live.”",
      "ko": "혹은 말하기를 우리와 우리 자녀가 많으니 곡식을 얻어 먹고 살아야 하겠다 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "9461dba8180b2a653a39f9d0aec0df89c617ff4805386f4099306cf3a3c4d792",
      "translation_text_hash": "8c52bc1674f2236c6ce46ed3703cae1587afcc1ee10f2f664b077f113fec1bea",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "혹은 말하기를 우리와 우리 자녀가 많으니 곡식을 얻어 먹고 살아야 하겠다 하고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8c52bc1674f2236c6ce46ed3703cae1587afcc1ee10f2f664b077f113fec1bea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:NEH:5:3",
      "sequence": 12386,
      "chapter_label": "NEH 5",
