        {
          "book": "NEH",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "I was very angry when I heard their cry and these words.",
      "ko": "내가 백성의 부르짖음과 이런 말을 듣고 크게 노하여",
      "source_text_hash": "183c1687acb134a05351bf84ad29f89de29e80c8d624240ecf790c5530cf6b7a",
      "translation_text_hash": "47d4bb900c938ac8824de6c41e3c849c8735b1137012a3c95cc3273e38a74314",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 백성의 부르짖음과 이런 말을 듣고 크게 노하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "47d4bb900c938ac8824de6c41e3c849c8735b1137012a3c95cc3273e38a74314"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:NEH:5:7",
      "sequence": 12390,
      "chapter_label": "NEH 5",
      "verse_label": "7",
      "locator": {
