      "en": "Yes, I also continued in the work of this wall. We didn’t buy any land. All my servants were gathered there to the work.",
      "ko": "도리어 이 성 역사에 힘을 다하며 땅을 사지 아니하였고 나의 모든 종자도 모여서 역사를 하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "3afb66c86b90f4dfe645e1a03a047e87d696df5c5c33b04b87a5896dd879a3dd",
      "translation_text_hash": "b587d3d7db7d0bce4e9a818346b5e5657ec928ce926c9f4f810705eae218b78c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
